The numbers is a list of 1000, 100, 10, and 2.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The result is empty text.
Place format whole number item 0 of numbers as text into result.
If last is 1, Place "/" into result, Place format whole number item 1 of numbers as text into result.
If last is more than 1, Place "/(" into result, Place format whole number item 1 of numbers as text into result.
For every spot from 2 to last, Place "/" into result, Place format whole number item spot of numbers as text into result.
If last is more than 1, Place ")" into result.

Show result.
